प्रति-√ बन्ध् P. Ā. -बध्नाति, -बध्नीते (ep. impf. also -अबन्धत्), to tie to, fasten, fix, moor (Ā., anything of one's own), ŚBr.; Hariv. &c.;
to set, enchase, MBh.;
to exclude, cut off, Ragh.; Kull.;
to keep back or off, keep at a distance, Daś.; Naiṣ.;
to stop, interrupt, Śak.

प्रति-√ बाध् Ā. -बाधते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to beat back, ward off, repel, MBh.; R.;
to check, restrain, ŚBr.;
to pain, torment, vex, Hariv.; R.

प्रति-√ बुध् Ā. -बुध्यते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to awaken (intr.), awake, wake, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to perceive, observe, learn, RV. (2. pf. Subj. -बु॑बोधथ; p. Ā. बु॑ध्यमान, ‘attentive’), AV.; Br.; BhP.;
to awaken (trans.), RV. :
Pass. (only aor. अबोधि) to expand, BhP. :
Caus. बोधयति, to awaken (trans.), Kāv.; Kathās.; BhP.;
to instruct, inform, admonish, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to commission, charge, order, MW.

प्रति-√ ब्रू P. Ā. -ब्रवीति, -ब्रूवे, to speak in reply, answer, RV. &c. &c. (also with 2 acc. R.);
 (Ā.) to answer i.e. return (an attack &c.), RV.;
to refuse, deny, BhP.
